  - elementId: dim-head
    elementType: text
    bounds: [690, 140, 206, 16]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      bold: true
      color: "$sub"
      text: 为什么是这五个维度
  - elementId: dim-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [690, 158, 206, 172]
    content:
      style: "$cap"
      text: |
        <p>· 数据：是否真实、带时间</p>
        <p>· 数值：能否复算</p>
        <p>· 账户：是否算现金与保证金</p>
